@startuml
left to right direction
actor Operator
actor "Human reviewer" as Human
actor GitHub
rectangle "Codex Ticket Enhancer" {
  usecase "Run one poll" as Poll
  usecase "Invoke read-only judge" as Judge
  usecase "Invoke read-only doer" as Doer
  usecase "Evaluate deterministic gates" as Gate
  usecase "Update issue and labels" as Update
}
Operator --> Poll
Poll .> Judge : includes
Poll .> Gate : includes
Poll .> Doer : includes
Poll --> Update
Human --> Update : LGTM
GitHub --> Update
@enduml
